# Normalise line endings in the repository, so a clone on Windows and one on Linux produce the same
# blobs and a diff never turns into "every line changed". The entrypoint script is the exception that
# has to be enforced rather than guessed: it runs inside a Linux container, and CRLF there makes the
# shell fail to find its own interpreter.
* text=auto

*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf

*.docx binary
